pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# MR-0 free-roam census from a pinned seed. Wait for the title screen before
# sending menu input; measure the capture-free drive after vehicle-moved.
# Collect the pass profile separately from knock-outs (timestamps perturb it).
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1 30000 file pressstart.wmv
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 960 3600 freeroam
capture 1200 parked
input 1400 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
wait 1410 2400 vehicle-moved 30
input 3610 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 3620 drive-end
stop 3630
